=============================

Voisr itself is MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

Two third-party items ship inside Voisr, and are listed first: a font and some
icons. It contains none of the other software or models below: the installer
downloads them to your Mac from their original sources.

Licence facts here were checked against the upstream LICENSE files, the package
metadata of the pinned versions, and the Homebrew formulae: on 2026-11-05 for
the font and icons, and on 2026-11-03 for the rest. Check upstream for anything
newer.


