  https://ffmpeg.org
  Installed by setup.sh. Voisr runs it as a separate program, only as a
  fallback recorder and to convert non-WAV files for `--mode file`.

Python -- Python Software Foundation License
  https://www.python.org/psf/license/  Not redistributed by Voisr.


